    "audio_frames": 76,
    "transcript": "Explain the difference between GPS mode and attitude mode.",
    "turn_id": "42c9d1b4613f-001",
    "response": "GPS mode uses the GPS position to maintain a fixed location or follow a waypoint, while attitude mode keeps the drone in a set orientation or attitude without relying on GPS for position. In GPS mode the controller uses location data; in attitude mode it only uses roll, pitch and yaw inputs.",
